            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.1.12

- Show when a check runs the full test suite, including the selected spec count and reason, in the app, CLI, and operator notices.
- Run optional credential validation only when requested; check required validation endpoints with a saved key at startup.
- Keep background connectivity monitoring from repeatedly calling credential validation endpoints.
]]></description>
